    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi egyo myenda ya bururu n'eya bujwa n'eya karari baagikoramu ebijwaro ebikozirwe gye eby'okukoresa omu Mwanya ogurikwera, kandi baakorera Arooni ebijwaro birikwera, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakora efodi n'emikwengye y'ezaabu n'ehuuzi za bururu na bujwa na karari na kitaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezaabu baagiheesha, yaaba akahwahwari, baagisharamu emikwegye y'okucwererana amabara omu myenda ya bururu n'eya bujwa n'eya karari n'eya bafuta, omurimo ogurikukorwa abanyamyoga b'obwengye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakorera efodi ebiremu by'aha mabega biteerainwe nayo aha mikugiro yaayo yombi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eky'okwezirikisa ekigikoreirweho, ekirukirwe abahangu, kyakorwa nkayo, kandi kyarukwa omu bintu bimwe n'ebyayo, emikwegye y'ezaabu, ehuuzi za bururu n'eza bujwa, n'eza karari, n'eza kitaani, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
