          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakikomaho otwenda twa bururu, kukikwatanisa n'ekyo kikwemba aharuguru, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
