              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'eby'okujwara ebibaziirwe gye eby'okukoresa omu Mwanya ogurikwera, n'ebijwaro ebirikwera ebya Arooni omunyamurwa n'eby'abatabani eby'okukoresa omurimo gw'obunyamurwa. ",
